WEBVTT

01:29.420 --> 01:32.990
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.560 --> 01:36.220
[Episode 9]

01:36.800 --> 01:37.810
-Let's go!
-Dao.

01:37.830 --> 01:38.740
What are you trying to do?

01:38.740 --> 01:39.759
Taking you out of Lingya Tower

01:39.759 --> 01:41.640
to find an antidote for you outside.

01:41.640 --> 01:42.039
Let's go!

01:42.039 --> 01:43.200
Dao, listen to me.

01:43.220 --> 01:44.080
Listen to me.

01:44.080 --> 01:44.770
Let's go.

01:44.960 --> 01:46.420
If we fight our way out now,

01:46.479 --> 01:47.530
before my snake venom is cured,

01:47.530 --> 01:48.440
I'll be dead.

01:48.479 --> 01:49.740
Then what should we do?

01:50.380 --> 01:51.979
Where can we get an antidote?

01:52.259 --> 01:53.300
Where is it?

01:55.000 --> 01:56.430
But Yanzhi,

01:57.039 --> 01:58.640
if the snake venom
reaches your heart meridian,

01:58.640 --> 01:59.759
it will be hard to remove it.

01:59.759 --> 02:01.290
If I were outside right now,

02:01.320 --> 02:02.860
I would definitely have a way to cure you.

02:02.860 --> 02:04.790
But there's nothing here.

02:04.920 --> 02:05.720
I...

02:06.440 --> 02:07.570
Your snake venom...

02:15.800 --> 02:16.600
What should I do?

02:16.600 --> 02:17.520
Well,

02:17.520 --> 02:18.320
it's fine.

02:18.340 --> 02:19.920
Just let nature take its course.

02:19.920 --> 02:21.300
Stop crying, both of you.

02:21.300 --> 02:22.290
Let nature take its course?

02:22.290 --> 02:23.390
You are about to die!

02:23.390 --> 02:26.320
How can you tell me
to just let nature take its course?

02:27.240 --> 02:28.040
Dao,

02:28.440 --> 02:30.100
since I'm going to die anyway,

02:30.160 --> 02:31.440
before I die,

02:31.800 --> 02:33.480
can you grant me one wish?

02:34.860 --> 02:36.480
What is your wish?

02:37.160 --> 02:38.320
I will help you fulfill it,

02:38.320 --> 02:39.650
no matter what it takes.

02:39.660 --> 02:42.079
I've noticed you've always treasured
your tiger‑head hat.

02:42.079 --> 02:43.480
I really want to know

02:43.720 --> 02:45.360
why it is so important to you.

02:46.200 --> 02:47.560
If you tell me,

02:47.860 --> 02:49.590
I'll know what I'm dying for,

02:50.490 --> 02:51.960
and it will be worth it.

02:53.520 --> 02:54.760
That's it?

02:55.120 --> 02:55.920
Mm.

02:59.440 --> 03:00.240
I'll tell you.

03:09.200 --> 03:10.520
I sewed this hat

03:11.000 --> 03:12.360
with my own hands...

03:14.360 --> 03:15.720
for my child.

03:19.740 --> 03:20.810
Her name is Doudou.

03:21.400 --> 03:22.560
She is a girl.

03:23.280 --> 03:24.480
She is very smart,

03:24.690 --> 03:25.860
very sensible,

03:26.680 --> 03:28.180
and very cute.

03:28.880 --> 03:29.900
In the past,

03:32.130 --> 03:33.620
I was a washerwoman.

03:36.100 --> 03:37.440
I made a living

03:38.360 --> 03:40.090
by washing clothes for others.

03:43.260 --> 03:45.550
Women like us who do manual labor

03:45.760 --> 03:47.690
have always been looked down upon.

03:49.000 --> 03:50.000
At that time,

03:50.500 --> 03:52.220
the men who came to my shop

03:52.360 --> 03:53.800
all treated me...

03:54.660 --> 03:56.780
as a garment they could try on at will,

03:57.610 --> 03:59.940
taking liberties with me as they pleased.

04:00.210 --> 04:01.330
Let go!

04:01.840 --> 04:03.520
They teased and insulted me.

04:04.740 --> 04:06.100
It was always like that,

04:06.840 --> 04:08.230
and I got used to it.

04:08.260 --> 04:09.260
You're back.

04:11.020 --> 04:11.690
Later,

04:13.040 --> 04:14.460
a constable in town

04:14.920 --> 04:17.850
came to my home
with a few ingots of silver to propose.

04:19.079 --> 04:21.010
My parents saw that he was generous

04:21.190 --> 04:22.720
and agreed to the marriage.

04:25.690 --> 04:26.790
At first,

04:27.460 --> 04:28.820
he treated me very well.

04:30.150 --> 04:31.770
I naively thought...

04:33.170 --> 04:34.630
I had found a good husband.

04:38.320 --> 04:39.450
Who would have known

04:40.980 --> 04:42.290
it was all bullshit?

04:44.200 --> 04:46.300
When he saw I gave birth to a girl,

04:46.440 --> 04:48.100
he was greatly disappointed.

04:48.100 --> 04:49.159
He didn't even hold her once,

04:49.159 --> 04:50.960
and he went out to seek pleasure.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.640
That bastard

04:53.659 --> 04:55.870
beat and cursed me every day.

04:55.890 --> 04:57.280
He even developed a gambling addiction.

04:57.280 --> 04:59.640
He sold every valuable thing in the house,

04:59.659 --> 05:02.790
completely ignoring
whether Doudou and I lived or died.

05:03.170 --> 05:05.970
I could only wash clothes for others
during the day

05:06.110 --> 05:07.570
and mend clothes at night.

05:08.810 --> 05:11.210
After he took my hard‑earned money,

05:11.240 --> 05:14.170
he even complained
the copper coins smelled of soap.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.240
Later,

05:18.010 --> 05:20.010
his gambling addiction grew worse.

05:21.100 --> 05:22.380
He even...

05:23.670 --> 05:25.570
even sold Doudou for money.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.330
Give me back my Doudou!

05:35.520 --> 05:39.610
[Indenture]

06:08.250 --> 06:10.980
So that's why you hate gambling so much.

06:11.080 --> 06:12.080
So,

06:12.270 --> 06:14.000
Dao, the reason
you want to get out so badly

06:14.000 --> 06:15.560
is just to find Doudou.

06:15.760 --> 06:17.480
Even if I spend my whole life

06:18.480 --> 06:20.050
and risk my life,

06:21.340 --> 06:22.540
I will go and find her.

06:24.190 --> 06:25.140
Dao.

06:26.680 --> 06:27.650
I believe

06:27.950 --> 06:29.610
you will definitely find her.

06:29.640 --> 06:30.440
Mm.

06:30.670 --> 06:32.080
Thank you, Nan Yanzhi.

06:37.090 --> 06:38.120
I'm sorry.

06:38.860 --> 06:40.230
You did it all to help me,

06:40.590 --> 06:42.140
and you saved me so many times.

06:42.140 --> 06:43.600
You almost lost your life.

06:43.720 --> 06:45.440
Actually, I'm already fine.

06:45.730 --> 06:47.400
That snake's venom can't kill me.

06:47.400 --> 06:48.600
How is that possible?

06:50.200 --> 06:51.440
What do you mean?

06:51.460 --> 06:52.980
I'm fine.

06:53.560 --> 06:54.480
Look.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.680
It's getting better.

06:56.159 --> 06:57.460
Are you sure you're fine?

06:57.460 --> 06:58.920
Are you sure you won't die?

06:59.720 --> 07:01.010
If you don't believe me, ask Man.

07:01.010 --> 07:01.860
It's true.

07:02.040 --> 07:04.200
Yanzhi's wound is already healing.

07:04.280 --> 07:05.840
She's out of danger now.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.040
You lied to me!

07:07.040 --> 07:08.960
You scared me to death!

07:13.830 --> 07:15.040
Nan Yanzhi.

07:18.610 --> 07:19.590
Thank you.

07:21.740 --> 07:22.540
Alright.

07:23.560 --> 07:25.130
Alright, alright.

07:25.960 --> 07:27.620
Right now,
the most important thing for us is

07:27.620 --> 07:30.620
to figure out a way
to survive tomorrow's death match.

07:31.300 --> 07:32.100
Mm.

07:32.890 --> 07:33.740
Yanzhi,

07:34.159 --> 07:35.760
have you thought of a new way?

07:36.360 --> 07:37.159
Mm.

07:39.970 --> 07:41.490
But I still need you, Man.

07:42.680 --> 07:43.200
Me?

07:53.780 --> 07:55.659
We don't have much thatch left.

07:55.690 --> 07:57.570
I would like to get some from you.

07:58.880 --> 07:59.400
Sure.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.510
Thanks.

08:17.180 --> 08:18.880
Ms. Kou. Let me help you.

08:19.720 --> 08:20.480
No need.

08:20.820 --> 08:21.580
It's okay.

08:21.610 --> 08:23.600
Let me help you. You get some rest.

08:25.880 --> 08:26.690
Thank you so much,

08:26.690 --> 08:27.530
Miss Man.

08:27.560 --> 08:28.360
It's nothing.

08:28.730 --> 08:30.540
With my condition,

08:30.640 --> 08:33.100
even washing clothes
is so difficult for me.

08:33.159 --> 08:34.640
I feel really bad about it.

08:34.669 --> 08:36.360
There's nothing to feel bad about.

08:36.360 --> 08:38.030
We are all in the death match together.

08:38.030 --> 08:39.630
We're in the same boat.

08:39.909 --> 08:41.909
Of course we should help each other.

08:44.300 --> 08:46.430
It's a pity that we're all going to die.

08:46.760 --> 08:49.600
If everyone could think the way you do,

08:49.760 --> 08:51.200
before we die,

08:51.580 --> 08:53.980
maybe we could
live a bit more comfortably.

08:54.560 --> 08:56.370
You don't need to be so sad.

08:56.560 --> 08:58.600
In addition to being sad,
what else can I do?

08:58.600 --> 08:59.920
Once tomorrow arrives,

08:59.920 --> 09:01.780
we'll have to accept our own fate.

09:06.690 --> 09:07.630
Ms. Kou.

09:08.320 --> 09:09.600
To be honest,

09:10.200 --> 09:12.900
there is a sure way
to win the death match.

09:13.780 --> 09:14.420
Really?

09:15.120 --> 09:16.580
Actually, it's like this.

09:21.960 --> 09:22.840
Tu Ya.

09:22.860 --> 09:24.860
Tell me how to win.

09:25.640 --> 09:26.880
How would I know?

09:27.650 --> 09:29.050
I just heard everything.

09:29.680 --> 09:32.400
You told Jiang Man and the others
there is a sure way to win.

09:32.400 --> 09:33.970
Then you should ask her.

09:34.520 --> 09:35.560
Every time I killed someone,

09:35.560 --> 09:37.620
they had a lot of complaints about me.

09:38.170 --> 09:40.720
Do you think they would tell me the truth?

09:43.960 --> 09:45.080
I can tell you.

09:46.920 --> 09:47.520
So...

09:48.360 --> 09:50.160
can you remove the dagger first?

09:52.840 --> 09:54.280
The token the mute servants hold

09:54.280 --> 09:55.480
has two sides.

09:55.760 --> 09:57.740
One side has engraved diamond patterns,

09:57.740 --> 09:58.660
rough and uneven.

09:58.010 --> 10:00.750
[Token]

09:58.760 --> 10:00.860
The other side is as smooth as a mirror.

10:00.860 --> 10:03.590
If you look closely,
you can tell the difference.

10:04.130 --> 10:05.880
The smooth side means betting lower.

10:05.880 --> 10:08.460
[Token]

10:07.540 --> 10:09.600
The rough side means betting higher.

10:11.620 --> 10:12.720
Is what you said...

10:13.860 --> 10:15.080
true?

10:17.120 --> 10:18.320
You don't believe me?

10:20.340 --> 10:22.380
Of course I believe you more.

10:22.410 --> 10:23.370
Compared to you,

10:24.710 --> 10:25.790
that person...

10:26.760 --> 10:27.880
is more dangerous.

10:34.560 --> 10:38.560
You mean... Jiang Man?

10:40.330 --> 10:42.480
You don't know her past.

10:43.660 --> 10:44.260
But I

10:44.920 --> 10:46.690
have seen her cruelty.

10:51.200 --> 10:52.520
[Token]

11:07.800 --> 11:10.520
Everyone, sorry to keep you waiting.

11:10.540 --> 11:12.780
The final round of this death match

11:12.810 --> 11:14.610
is about to begin.

11:14.630 --> 11:15.350
Wait.

11:15.600 --> 11:17.800
If we still split into pairs and compete
against each other in the third round,

11:17.800 --> 11:19.300
it would be too boring.

11:19.330 --> 11:20.130
Oh?

11:20.730 --> 11:22.130
Then what do you suggest?

11:22.280 --> 11:23.320
How about...

11:24.610 --> 11:27.960
each of our two sides
sends one representative?

11:28.300 --> 11:29.520
If we win,

11:29.560 --> 11:32.760
all the female prisoners here
will go to the fourth level.

11:34.460 --> 11:35.940
And if you lose?

11:36.840 --> 11:37.440
If we lose,

11:37.440 --> 11:39.200
naturally everyone else and I will stay,

11:39.200 --> 11:40.360
at your disposal.

11:40.440 --> 11:41.280
Mm.

11:42.930 --> 11:44.690
This bet is interesting.

11:44.840 --> 11:45.670
But...

11:45.700 --> 11:46.730
But what?

11:46.760 --> 11:47.800
I wasn't asking you.

11:47.800 --> 11:49.160
A matter of such importance

11:49.160 --> 11:50.800
is not something you can decide.

11:50.800 --> 11:52.840
Haha.

11:52.840 --> 11:54.040
What a joke.

11:54.040 --> 11:56.000
If I can't make the decision,

11:56.030 --> 11:57.280
who else can?

11:57.560 --> 11:59.060
Naturally...

12:00.640 --> 12:02.130
Ms. Kou.

12:13.390 --> 12:14.190
Me?

12:17.810 --> 12:19.920
I'm just a weak woman.

12:20.220 --> 12:21.770
Without this crutch,

12:22.360 --> 12:23.750
I'm afraid I wouldn't even make it

12:23.750 --> 12:24.950
past the third level.

12:25.630 --> 12:27.220
Why ask me?

12:27.380 --> 12:28.720
You can't get out

12:28.880 --> 12:31.450
because you simply don't need to.

12:31.700 --> 12:32.820
Am I right,

12:33.180 --> 12:34.790
Lord Voice-Keeper?

12:38.060 --> 12:39.140
Miss Nan,

12:39.170 --> 12:40.810
please don't make fun of me.

12:42.250 --> 12:44.190
Ms. Kou, no need to be modest.

12:44.400 --> 12:45.880
You're a voice-keeper,

12:45.880 --> 12:48.040
yet you're willing to stay among us.

12:48.410 --> 12:50.460
You really have exceptional courage.

12:50.460 --> 12:51.850
Miss Nan,

12:52.020 --> 12:53.680
what do you mean?

12:56.370 --> 12:59.080
First, there are no calluses
where your hand holds the crutch.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.770
That means your injury is not an old one.

13:00.770 --> 13:01.920
Having a crippled leg

13:01.920 --> 13:02.840
and knowing no martial arts,

13:02.840 --> 13:05.120
how did you manage
to survive the death match

13:05.120 --> 13:08.050
from the bottom level
to the third level step by step?

13:11.930 --> 13:15.480
They just took pity on me

13:16.150 --> 13:17.680
because of my crippled leg.

13:19.360 --> 13:20.280
Second,

13:20.960 --> 13:22.320
he doesn't have

13:22.650 --> 13:24.440
a guiding ring on his finger.

13:29.480 --> 13:31.640
Moreover,
Jiang Man went to your room last night

13:31.640 --> 13:34.320
and deliberately told you
how to win the death match.

13:34.320 --> 13:36.660
I said the token had engraved patterns,

13:36.690 --> 13:39.040
but I didn't say
they were engraved diamond patterns.

13:39.040 --> 13:42.090
Yet you mentioned it when you told Tu Ya.

13:45.980 --> 13:48.500
Did I say
they were engraved diamond patterns?

13:48.500 --> 13:49.430
I'm afraid...

13:50.250 --> 13:51.750
you misremembered it, Miss Tu Ya.

13:51.750 --> 13:53.150
I didn't misremember it.

13:53.430 --> 13:55.960
And the answer you told me
was the exact opposite.

13:55.960 --> 13:58.620
You never wanted me to leave here alive,
did you?

13:59.640 --> 14:00.650
In our tribe,

14:01.120 --> 14:02.080
those who don't keep their word

14:02.080 --> 14:03.680
shall be publicly executed.

14:03.990 --> 14:05.920
You told her everything I told you?

14:09.450 --> 14:10.510
When did you two...

14:11.240 --> 14:13.760
become so close?

14:15.530 --> 14:17.660
We haven't known each other for long,

14:17.880 --> 14:18.950
but we

14:19.030 --> 14:21.010
both want to live.
